        "investigation": [
          "Verified voice data format is compatible",
          "Confirmed audio channels are available",
          "Checked DMA transfer settings",
          "Tested with different audio priorities",
          "Examined timer configurations"
        ],
        "root_cause": "Voice clips were using Direct Sound Channel A, which conflicts with game's existing audio system on hardware. Emulators handle channel conflicts differently than real hardware.",
        "technical_details": {
